WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.847
Before leaving a session, press Stop and wait for Saved. On hardware, the message is Saved on stick.

2
00:00:05.924 --> 00:00:10.956
Hold Menu and press pad five for Project. Pad fifteen saves the current project.

3
00:00:10.956 --> 00:00:16.522
Pad sixteen opens Save as. Give this version a name, so you've got something easy to find in Browse.

4
00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:20.486
Pad fourteen confirms the name. Wait for the save result before moving on.

5
00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:27.041
In Project, pad fourteen opens saved projects. Select the copy with pad thirteen, then press the dial to load it.

6
00:00:27.041 --> 00:00:34.975
Main brings back the clips. In the browser, Download saved project also gives you a file copy. Now you know the project opens again.
